---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RippleField from '../../components/RippleField';
---
<Layout title="像素潮汐 · buluku 的小实验" description="用光标拨动点阵，让一片像素海泛起涟漪。">
  <section class="lab-page">
    <a href="/#playground" class="lab-back">返回小玩意</a>
    <div class="lab-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker mono">EXPERIMENT 002 / MOTION</p><h1>像素潮汐<span class="blue-period">.</span></h1></div><p>有时候，发一会儿呆也是正经事。</p></div>
    <RippleField client:load expanded />
    <div class="lab-instructions"><p>移动光标拨动点阵，点击画面投下一颗石子。<br />用滑块改变波动幅度，或者暂停，让时间停一会儿。</p><span class="mono">MADE FOR NO PARTICULAR REASON</span></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
